>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"sun\">\n        <div class=\"rays\">\n          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"face\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cloud\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"title\">\n        <span class=\"orange\">小学语文</span><span class=\"blue\">阅读理解答题技巧</span><span class=\"deep\">518条</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <aside class=\"tabs\">\n      <span>01</span><span>02</span><span>03</span><span>04</span><span>05</span>\n      <span>06</span><span>07</span><span>08</span><span>09</span><span>10</span>\n      <span>11</span><span>12</span><span>13</span><span>14</span><span>15</span>\n    </aside>\n\n    <section class=\"sheet\">\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"heading\">答题方式：</div>\n\n        <p class=\"gold\"><span class=\"aqua\">①</span> 不能，用了“××”词，生动地说明了……，能够激发读者的<br>兴趣，去掉就没有这种效果。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"gold\"><span class=\"aqua\">②</span> 不能，删掉“××”词，句子的意思就变成了……，显得太绝<br>对化，用了“××”词，准确地说明了……，符合实际情况，留<br>有余地，具有科学性。</p>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">🍀 常见段入几方面考虑：</div>\n\n        <p class=\"rose\"><span class=\"aqua\">①</span> 内容：写了什么，选择有什么独特之处</p>\n        <p class=\"rose\"><span class=\"aqua\">②</span> 形式：写作方法，语言特色</p>\n        <p class=\"rose tight\"><span class=\"aqua\">③</span> 修辞：①比喻：生动形象&nbsp; ②拟人：形象生动&nbsp;③张：突出<br>特征&nbsp;④排比：加强语气&nbsp;⑤反问：态度鲜明，增强语气</p>\n        <p class=\"rose\"><span class=\"aqua\">④</span> 感情：文章的社会价值，意义，作用等</p>\n        <p class=\"rose\"><span class=\"aqua\">⑤</span> 结构：在全文中的作用</p>\n\n        <div class=\"check-title\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>10.景物描写的作用</div>\n        <p class=\"gold indented\">交代故事发生的时间、地点；渲染气氛，烘托人物心情；表<br>现人物性格；推动情节的发展。</p>\n\n        <div class=\"check-title\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>11.记叙的顺序：顺叙，倒叙，插叙(补叙属于插叙的一种)</div>\n        <div class=\"check-title\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>12.写作人称的好处</div>\n\n        <div class=\"numbered\">\n          <p class=\"gold\"><span class=\"aqua\">①</span> 第一人称：真实可信；</p>\n          <p class=\"gold\"><span class=\"aqua\">②</span> 第二人称：亲切自然；</p>\n          <p class=\"gold\"><span class=\"aqua\">③</span> 第三人称：可以多角度描写，不受时间和空间的限制。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>",
